        <h1 class="page-title">GadJet Display Visualiser</h1>
        <p class="case-kicker"><span>3D + Web development + AR</span><span class="case-meta-year"><i></i><time>2026</time></span></p>
        <p class="case-deck">An interactive 3D retail-display experience that allows B2B customers to preview display units at accurate scale within their own stores using mobile augmented reality.</p>
        <div class="case-actions"><a class="button case-website" href="https://gadjetuk.com/displays" rel="noreferrer" data-button-motion><span class="button-label">Explore the Display Visualiser ↗</span></a></div>
