<p>On desktop, customers can rotate, zoom and pan around each display while viewing its dimensions, capacity and product information. Touch controls provide the same inspection workflow on mobile without requiring specialist software or a separate download.</p>
<p>The viewer keeps the model and practical specification together, allowing visual assessment and product comparison to happen in one place. The work is published across three live catalogue surfaces: the GadJet catalogue, the Goodiz catalogue and the GadJet Displays hub, which brings the AR-enabled stands from both brands together.</p>
<figure class="case-media case-embed"><div class="case-embed-frame" style="aspect-ratio: 320 / 207"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/LKF8wAFyq2M?color=white" title="Walkthrough of the GadJet display catalogue and interactive 3D viewer" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><figcaption>A walkthrough of the display catalogue and interactive 3D viewer.</figcaption></figure>
<div class="section-heading case-section-heading" id="accurate-scale-augmented-reality"><h2>Accurate-scale augmented reality</h2><span aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
<p>The browser-based viewer supports the main modern desktop and mobile browsers. On relatively recent Android and iOS devices with native AR support, a selected stand can be placed directly on the shop floor. The life-size models help customers assess height, visual presence and general placement; rear support clearances are not represented in the AR preview.</p>
<p>The experience turns the 3D catalogue into a practical planning tool: instead of imagining a stand from measurements alone, retailers can preview it within the environment where it will actually be used. Reflective material details were retained so the glossy and foil-finished graphics continue to respond as the customer moves around the model.</p>
<p class="case-takeaway">From product dimensions to a life-size in-store preview.</p>
