<p>These placements show counter and floor-standing displays in retail-style interiors as well as outdoor and indoor test settings. They demonstrate how AR can help customers judge a stand’s presence among surrounding fixtures before ordering. Two images place virtual and physical stands together to compare their proportions.</p>
