<div class="section-heading case-section-heading" id="outcome"><h2>Outcome</h2><span aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
<p>The finished system gives B2B customers one consistent way to explore 11 counter, modular and floor-standing displays across GadJet and Goodiz before ordering. It is published through the GadJet catalogue, Goodiz catalogue and GadJet Displays hub.</p>
<p>Rather than using 3D solely as presentation imagery, the visualiser makes the assets functional decision-making tools. The shared modelling, optimisation, lighting and platform-preparation process also provides a repeatable route for future stands.</p>
